{"rank": 133, "root": "عصي", "form": 1, "lemma": "عَصَى", "count": 27, "ayahCount": 27, "share": 0.14, "meaning": {"bs": "ne poslušati, biti neposlušan", "en": "to disobey", "tr": "isyan etmek, itaatsizlik etmek", "fr": "désobéir", "id": "durhaka, bermaksiat", "ur": "نافرمانی کرنا", "bn": "অবাধ্য হওয়া, নাফরমানি করা", "fa": "نافرمانی کردن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/756bd13be64176e03b39.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-asa_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes asa_1-a{from{transform:rotate(0)}}.va-asa_1 .a .ra{transform:rotate(-92deg);animation:asa_1-a .4s ease-out both}@keyframes asa_1-ws{from{transform:rotate(-24deg)}}@keyframes asa_1-wt{from{transform:rotate(24deg)}}.va-asa_1 .b .ll,.va-asa_1 .b .ra{transform:rotate(24deg);animation:asa_1-ws 0.5s ease-in-out 0.6s 5 alternate both}.va-asa_1 .b .rl,.va-asa_1 .b .la{transform:rotate(-24deg);animation:asa_1-wt 0.5s ease-in-out 0.6s 5 alternate both}@keyframes asa_1-m{from{transform:translateX(-38px)}}.va-asa_1 .b .fig{animation:asa_1-m 2.5s linear 0.6s both}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-asa_1.off,.va-asa_1.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-asa_1,.va-asa_1 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M6 61H114\"/><path class=\"p\" d=\"M110 61V34M110 35h-8l2 4-2 4h8\"/><g class=\"a\"><g transform=\"translate(64 44)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"la\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"ra\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g></g></g></g></g><g class=\"b\" transform=\"ma